    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luuzi kūpūmbīīla shilīwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Naomi walī na dūgūye ū kū lwande lwa kū būkwiye, ū kū ndūgū ja ng'wa Elimeleki; ū ndūgūye ng'wenūyo ī lina lyakwe witanagwa Boazi; ngosha nsabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Luuzi ū muna Moabu ūng'wīla ū nina būkwi ū Naomi gīkī, “Mayū naje kū migūnda ya bagesi, ūyo alanikūlīlwe nakūmanūūpūmbīla malagalīkwa ga shilīwa ayo galīyūlekeelwa kū numa.” Naomi ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Jaaga dūhū ng'wana wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūja ūūkandya kūpūmbīīla mu ngūnda nebe kū numa ya bagesi. Gashinaga ū ngūnda ūyo akashikīla gūbiza go ng'wa Boazi, munhū wa mu lūdūgū lwa ng'wa Elimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lītabītile ikanza ū Boazi nang'hwe wiza kūfuma Betelehemu; ūshikīla kūbagīsha a bagesi bakwe gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Boazi ūmūūja ū ntaale wa bagesi bakwe, “Ū shīke ng'wenūyū wa kū ng'wa nani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū ntaale wa bagesi ūshosha, “Angū ū ng'wenūyo hū ng'wene ū muna Moabu ūyo wizile na Naomi kūfuma Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Washikaga a henaha ūhaya, ‘Nalīlomba naje nūūpūmbīīla na kūsoleleja a mangala ayo galīīsaagīīla mu mabelele na a malagalīkwa ayo galīīlekwa hasī kū numa ya bagesi.’ Yū, baayīnga watūmama būlī, nguno wandyaga dilū kūshisha ikanza īlī; ūlū ītī kakanza kaguhī dūhū ako waalī waaja kwifuula hado mu mbeho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Boazi kwīta yawiza kūlī Luuzi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Boazi ūng'wīla ū Luuzi gīkī, “Alinidegelekage ng'wana wane, yaya ū kwīnga ū mu ngūnda gwenūyū ūje kūpūmbīīla kū migūnda yīngī; bebe diimanaga nabo dūhū a batūmami bane a bashīke benaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūdīlīīlage ū nīmo ūje ūkūbakūūbījaga a hanuma yabo; a basūmba bene naabahūgūlaga batizikala bakūkwīgīja malang'wa. A minzī ga kūng'wa galīho beenhaga a basūmba, ūlū ūkolwa notà jaga dūhū ūkasole ū mu shiseme shise ūng'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Luuzi aho wigwa ī mihayo yenīyo ūtuja mazwi hasī, hama winama kūshisha ūkuumya hasī ū būshū, ūhaya gīkī, “Yee baba, būtogwa kī ū wenūbū, shakwenheleja kī nose ūnibone na nene, munhū ngeni wa kūfuma kūle gīko?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Boazi ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Naawīlilwe īyo ūkūng'wītīlaga ū noko būkwi, kūfuma a h'ikanza lya ngoshi wako kūzumalīka; nī gīkī wabalekile a ba so nū noko hamò nī sī ya ng'wing'we, wiza kwikala na banhū abo walī ūtabamanile kūfuma kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leka ū Seeba akūshokeje mu yose īyo wayītile, ū Seeba ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli ni akūnong'hage inong'ho lyawiza; ūyo bebe wizile kūlang'hanwa mu mbeho ya manana gakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Luuzi ūhaya, “Baba leka nongeje kwanukūlwa ū mu miso gako; wanilūngūja no nguno walūngalūnga mihayo milyehu ū kūlī nsese wako, nūūlū īkī ū nene natigeleelilwe kūlenganījiwa nūūlū na ūmò wa basese bako a bakīma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A h'ikanza lya shilīwa ū Boazi ūng'wīla, “Egeelaga aha tūlye; ūyūsombya nū ngatī gwako ū mu divai.” Ū Luuzi aho igaashije akūlyaga na a bagesi, ū Boazi ūng'winha matwajo gakalangile; ūlya kūshisha wigeja, ūsaaja gamò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūbūūka kwandya kūtūmama ū nshīke ng'wenūyo, ū Boazi ūbakomeleja a batūmami bakwe a bagosha alīhaya, “Ng'ūneka wasola na a mangala a matengeke, yaya ū kūng'hama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ūng'wīngīja nī sha mu miligo īyo ng'watungaga ng'wantūūlīla ha mhūjo wayūūbīnzagūla; yaya ū kūng'hama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gashi ū Boazi ndūgū wa mu kaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Luuzi ūpūmbīīla ī shilīwa kūshisha līīmi lya mhīndī; hūna ūtūla īsho akapandīka, ūgwaasha sha kwigela kookal'idebbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbūūcha atwaalile kaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kaya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, mu nzengo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " aho washika ūng'olekeja ū nina būkwi īsho akapandīka. Ūshifunya nī shilīwa īsho walī wasaaja aho walya wigūta, ūng'winha ū nina būkwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nina būkwi ūmūūja, “Walī wakapūmbīīlīlaga he ī lelo? Halī ūko walūtūmamīlīlaga? Ū munhū ūyo walī wakūyegelaga ng'wenūyo ūkūgunanha na kūkūgunanha ni īīlūkīlagwe mbango!” Hūna ū Luuzi ūng'wīla ū nina būkwi ī mihayo ya ng'wa munhū ūyo watūmamaga kū ng'wakwe, ūhaya, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ī lina lyakwe Boazi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nina būkwi ūng'wīla, “Ū SSEEBA ūyo ataalī kooya kūbīītīla yawiza a bapanga na a bachiile, ni ang'wīlūkīlage ū ng'wenūyo.” Ongeja kūhaya, “Ū Boazi ndūgū o mu kaya gete; ashikile nūūlū kwingīla kaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Luuzi ūhaya hangī, “Walī waniwīla na gīkī, ‘Nzūgū ūyūtūmama nabo a bagesi bane kūshisha gūshile ū nīmo gwa kūgesa ī shilīwa shane.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Naomi ūng'wīla ū ng'wīnga okwe gīkī, “Ng'hana ī chene īkūbeelela ng'wana wane ūtūmame nabo a baanikī bakwe, nguno ūlū ūja kū migūnda yīngī ūdūgije kwītīlwa wibonya na banhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
